OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fcloudier this evening particularly
OL,7,Facross Cornwall with an increasing
OL,8,Fchance of some showers. Turning widely
OL,9,Fcloudy overnight with showery rain
OL,10,Fpossible throughout the region.
OL,11,FModerate to fresh westerly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain. Gradually turning
OL,15,Fdrier and a little brighter by the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Feeling fresher than of
OL,17,Flate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
