OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely dry through the start of next
OL,7,Fweek, with variable cloud and sunny
OL,8,Fspells, and a small chance of isolated
OL,9,Fshowers on Monday and Tuesday. Turning
OL,10,Fwarmer through the week.
